    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For fine-tuning, our company's can use methods like LoRA, QLoRA, or Full fine-tune on domain corpus to adapt the model to the client's specific needs. our company's average accuracy gain from fine-tuning is around 12%, which can lead to significant improvements in answer quality." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate explainability and transparency, our company's can utilize our company's XAI methods, including Source citation (RAG grounding), Chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME. our company's also have confidence scoring capabilities, with a low-confidence threshold of 0.65, which triggers an uncertainty warning and escalation to human supervisors. our company's past AI use cases in public administration, legal sector, healthcare, and smart city domains demonstrate our company's ability to deliver effective AI solutions that meet regulatory and legal constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Specifically, our company's can draw from our company's experience with the Regulatory document Q&A assistant, Contract review and clause extraction, Clinical guideline assistant for practitioners, and Multi-source data synthesis for urban planners." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance benchmarks, our company's models have achieved high relevance scores, and our company's can guarantee a certain level of availability and response time, as required by the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering our company's known trade-offs, such as explicability vs. performance, online learning vs. GDPR, model size vs. energy, and RAG vs. fine-tuning, our company's will need to balance these factors to ensure that our company's solution meets The client requirements while also being compliant with regulatory constraints and environmentally sustainable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, by combining our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, and past AI use cases, our company's can develop a comprehensive AI solution that addresses The client needs for facilitating access to information, improving answer quality, reducing processing time, demonstrating explainability and transparency, and complying with regulatory and legal constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact. a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and relies on infrastructures with low carbon impact must also comply with environmental constraints, including limiting the environmental footprint of the city's information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, what are the key CSR and sustainability measures that our company's will implement to meet the key CSR and sustainability measures that we will implement to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The client requirements, our company's will implement the key CSR and sustainability measures that we will implement to meet these requirements." ;
